{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T16:40:48.057Z","ordinal":16093,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0200a-63d8-7b21-adef-c3850aecebf7","turn_id":"01a02f65-7c17-7a30-9a2a-f255f8bc2ae4","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0873a68aa02aff8f016a8b228e13ac8198920ab7a2953b3e3b","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The quality gate is stricter than the runtime gate, as it should be. It confirms protocol/cache isolation, but it also caught one genuine plan-level recall gap: Phase 1 only admits direct-user triggers, so verified or explicitly accepted assistant discoveries never reach Phase 2. I’m separating that necessary recall fix from evidence we cannot honestly claim yet (human-labeled precision/recall and observed token/latency)."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787503246046,"completed_at_ms":1787503248057}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T16:40:48.073Z","ordinal":16094,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0873a68aa02aff8f016a8b228e13ac8198920ab7a2953b3e3b","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The quality gate is stricter than the runtime gate, as it should be. It confirms protocol/cache isolation, but it also caught one genuine plan-level recall gap: Phase 1 only admits direct-user triggers, so verified or explicitly accepted assistant discoveries never reach Phase 2. I’m separating that necessary recall fix from evidence we cannot honestly claim yet (human-labeled precision/recall and observed token/latency)."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a02f65-7c17-7a30-9a2a-f255f8bc2ae4"}}}
