f(\\\"deterministic session order = %v, want %v\\\", got, want)\\n+\\t}\\n+}\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a02f65-7c17-7a30-9a2a-f255f8bc2ae4"}}}
