\")\n}\n"}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA /Users/thomi/Projects/entire-brain/internal/cli/zz_phase2_ollama_inspect_test.go\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1787504249439,"completed_at_ms":1787504249439}}
