{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T17:00:53.817Z","ordinal":16751,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a02f91-68b9-7640-885c-a73547611969","call_id":"call_cNzhnjyusolt0xkY3gtRKqR8","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/phase2_quality_gate\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/phase2_runtime_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Re-review: no HIGH or MEDIUM blockers found.\\n\\nAll three prior findings are addressed:\\n\\n- Retry children retain the failed parent’s pool lease through the serial bisection at [distill_shadow_v2.go:191](/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-brain/internal/cli/distill_shadow_v2.go:191), so provider concurrency remains within `--concurrency`.\\n- Live and dry-run both use the same total session ordering helper at [distill_cmd.go:886](/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-brain/internal/cli/distill_cmd.go:886) and [distill_cmd.go:1797](/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-brain/internal/cli/distill_cmd.go:1797).\\n- Dry-run retains admitted `CandidateCards`; misses now affect only predicted packs/calls at [distill_cmd.go:1489](/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-brain/internal/cli/distill_cmd.go:1489).\\n\\nThe candidate-v2 decoded-output limit is correctly scoped through the attempt context and applied by default command and Ollama runners; the structured-output envelope remains separately bounded. Assistant admission is conservative: it requires a successful checkpoint outcome, a full touched-file path bounded match, allowed cue type, and non-review/non-status session conditions. No runtime regression found.\\n\\nVerification passed:\\n\\n`go test -race ./internal/cli -run 'TestCandidateShadowV2|TestCandidateAssistantClaimRequiresSuccessfulSameFileCheckpoint|Test.*Distill.*Output|Test.*Deterministic.*Distill' -count=1`\\n\\n`go test ./internal/cli -count=1`\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/phase2_security_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"No HIGH or M